    - Dotted and indexed paths: `$a.b`, `$rows.0.field`.
    
    ## Predicate ops (exact spellings)
    
    `decision.branches[*].when` accepts ONLY these ops — use the exact spelling:
    
    - Leaf: `eq`, `ne`, `lt`, `le`, `gt`, `ge`, `nonempty`, `isnull`,
